<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Prebon Yamane in venture with S.Africa's Equisec.</title>
<headline>Prebon Yamane in venture with S.Africa's Equisec.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Prebon Yamane and South Africa's Equisec said they were forming a joint venture to offer voice-executed screen broking services in rand-based treasury products.</p>
<p>The joint venture, to be called Prebon Equisec, will have to be approved by South Africa's Reserve Bank, the Financial Services Board and the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>--Johannesburg newsroom -27-11-482.1003</p>
</text>
